OL,3,GNEWSA'Rare opportunity' to buy land
OL,4,Aincluding Zip World and two power
OL,5,Astations
OL,6,
OL,7,FA huge estate featuring an outdoor
OL,8,Fadventure park, a hotel and historic
OL,9,Fquarries, set within Eryri National
OL,10,FPark, is on the market.
OL,12,FThe 1,900-acre site covers the
OL,13,FFfestiniog and Llechwedd quarries in
OL,14,Fthe historic slate mining town of
OL,15,FBlaenau Ffestiniog in Gwynedd, and also
OL,16,Fincludes two hydroelectric power
OL,17,Fstations.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
