OL,3,GNEWSA'Rare opportunity' to buy land
OL,4,Aincluding Zip World and two power
OL,5,Astations
OL,6,
OL,7,FProperty advisers Christie & Co began
OL,8,Fadvertising the north Wales heritage
OL,9,Festate, which forms part of the UNESCO
OL,10,FSlate Landscape of Northwest Wales, on
OL,11,FThursday. The company did not reveal
OL,12,Fthe asking price.
OL,14,FJonathan Watson, director for
OL,15,Finvestments at Christie & Co, said:
OL,16,F"From an investment perspective,
OL,17,Fopportunities of this nature are
OL,18,Fexceptionally rare."
